{"_id":"6a97f6e4acf3881f66f2e41c","id":"THULab/wids2023_competition_weather_forecasting","author":"THULab","sha":"2ee0047ff2b8914b5221b4b6d7b6a90ad2ddf4ce","lastModified":"2026-09-07T11:13:26.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["task_categories:tabular-regression","task_categories:time-series-forecasting","language:en","license:cc-by-nc-4.0","size_categories:100K<n<1M","modality:timeseries","region:us","tsfile","timeseries","modality:timeseries","format:tsfile","weather","climate","forecasting","wids-2023"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWiDS 2023 Weather Forecasting (TsFile format)\n\t\n\nApache TsFile conversion of mirai-ml/wids2023_competition_weather_forecasting. The repository contains both source splits from the same Hugging Face dataset.\nModalities: Time-series.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThe WiDS Datathon 2023 task forecasts the arithmetic mean of the maximum and minimum temperature over the following 14 days for each US location and start date. The source combines weather, climate, forecast-model, and oscillation… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/THULab/wids2023_competition_weather_forecasting.","downloads":234,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":"cc-by-nc-4.0","language":["en"],"task_categories":["tabular-regression","time-series-forecasting"],"size_categories":["100K<n<1M"],"tags":["tsfile","timeseries","modality:timeseries","format:tsfile","weather","climate","forecasting","wids-2023"],"modality":"timeseries","pretty_name":"WiDS 2023 Weather Forecasting (TsFile format)","configs":[{"config_name":"train","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"wids2023_weather_train_*.tsfile"}]},{"config_name":"test","data_files":[{"split":"test","path":"wids2023_weather_test_*.tsfile"}]}]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"wids2023_weather_test.tsfile"},{"rfilename":"wids2023_weather_train.tsfile"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T10:13:56.000Z